From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: subarr-subgen <subarr@localhost>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:05:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] 0055: bump patch rev to v4.32

Ships 0054: a direct (queue-bypassing) model use is now claimed atomically
against the idle model cleanup, so /detect-language can no longer fail with
"No model replica is available in this thread" when a request lands between
the cleanup's idle check and its unload (subarr-subgen#69).

Behaviour change on a real endpoint, so the rev moves: an install on this
image is distinguishable, and subarr can tell whether the subgen it is
talking to still has the race.
---
diff --git a/subgen.py b/subgen.py
--- a/subgen.py
+++ b/subgen.py
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ subgen_version = '2026.08.1'
 # [v4.3 PATCH] subarr-subgen patch-stack revision, surfaced via /queue so subarr
 # can detect our extended capabilities (audio_language_override, etc.) and
 # degrade gracefully against vanilla mccloud/subgen which lacks them.
-subarr_subgen_patch_rev = 'v4.31'
+subarr_subgen_patch_rev = 'v4.32'

 """
 ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES DOCUMENTATION
